      "post_subject": "A world map of holographers?",
      "content_md": "> **Steve M:** Very cool map Kevah. It's interesting to see where everyone is located.Thanks for putting this together.\n\nIt was trivial to set up, but I am so happy people are signing on. I find that often I am travelling for my \"day\" job, and because I am in that mode, I don't think of looking up a holographer who might be nearby.\n\nThere are some limitations with this. I wish people could log in and change what they had entered. Seems I am the only one who can do that.",
