      "post_subject": "A world map of holographers?",
      "content_md": "Thank you JohnFP and DJ Mathson for the nice compliments on my revised website. The diagrams and photos were like 10 years old. The new 3D diagrams gives beginners more spatial information to help them with their setups. I'm slowly animating these setup diagrams for even more spatial information. You can see the ones that are done under Testing for Vibrations, SB Transmission Hologram and SB Reflection Hologram. I'm looking forward to many more discussions with all of you in times to come.",
